  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Blueberry jam is quiet to make,  the berries soften fast, the lemon juice pulls a reliable set, and the whole batch is done in under 30 minutes. The flavour is clean and sweet-tart, and the colour holds a deep indigo in the jar. Makes about three 450 g jars."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
